runtime: pass owned listeners to virtiofsd

Use the configured daemon's listening-FD API for both K machine classes so
new runs do not leave companion pidfiles after process shutdown. Retain
private directory/socket inode proof and refuse replaced or unsafe paths
before exact cleanup while preserving OSVM daemon tracking and reapers.

Old pidfile namespaces remain strict refusals; this adds no adoption or
cleanup route for retained runs and changes no persistent schema.
